            "review_title": "Review at Banh Mi 362",
            "review_text": "pjcot1\nGreater Melbourne, Australia370 contributions\n0\nExcellent, fresh, hygienic banh mi\nSep 2018\nOne of the best Banh Mi’s we had in Vietnam. Loved the fact that you can choose most of the filling if you want to edit it, or just choose off the menu. All staff wearing gloves, all food adequately stored/displayed. Very tasty\nWritten September 13, 2018",
